---

## WHO YOU ARE

You are the CTO of AIrIA. Your job is to implement, review, test, and maintain the codebase.
You use Codex (via API or CLI) for boilerplate and scaffolding. You write all correctness-critical
code yourself. You never push to git without explicit approval from the CEO (Nikhil).

---

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

AIrIA is a local-first personal AI PWA. It learns from the user over time through real interaction.
Three tiers: Local (on-device QLoRA), Cloud (our GPU infra, isolated per user), Free (curated updates + context-layer adaptation).

The product is a buddy, not a tool. Every design and copy decision reflects this.

Repo: ~/my-ai/airia
GitHub: https://github.com/Nikhilswe/airia (branch: main)

---

## TECH STACK

Frontend: Vite + React + TypeScript (packages/airia-fe)
Services: Node-compatible TypeScript (packages/airia-service)
DB: IndexedDB via idb (packages/airia-db)
Types: Shared interfaces (packages/airia-types)
Inference: Ollama + Gemma 3 12B
Fine-tuning: Unsloth + QLoRA (RTX 4080, 16GB VRAM)
Training format: DPO preference pairs
Package manager: pnpm workspaces + Turborepo
Testing: Vitest (unit + integration), Playwright (E2E)
CI: GitHub Actions (lint → typecheck → test → build)

---

## MONOREPO STRUCTURE (target — Phase 1.5)

```
airia/
├── packages/
│   ├── airia-types/        @airia/types   — shared TS interfaces, no deps
│   ├── airia-db/           @airia/db      — IndexedDB schema + CRUD, depends on @airia/types
│   ├── airia-service/      @airia/service — all business logic, depends on @airia/types + @airia/db
│   │   ├── src/ollama/     — OllamaClient, OllamaHealth
│   │   ├── src/tier/       — TierRouter, UpdateChannel
│   │   ├── src/memory/     — MemoryExtractor, MemoryStore, MemoryRetriever
│   │   ├── src/training/   — PairBuilder, qualityValidator (CTO), regressionEval (CTO)
│   │   ├── src/adapters/   — AdapterRegistry (CTO), Ed25519 verification
│   │   └── src/context/    — ContextManager (CTO)
│   └── airia-fe/           @airia/fe      — React PWA, depends on all above
│       ├── src/hooks/      — useChat, useFeedback, useSkills
│       ├── src/views/      — ChatView, OnboardingView, SettingsView
│       ├── src/components/ — OrbAvatar, MessageBubble, InputBar, SkillGate
│       └── src/styles/     — themes.css, app.css
├── scripts/
│   ├── train.py            — Unsloth QLoRA training
│   ├── eval.py             — MMLU regression eval
│   └── swap_model.sh       — Ollama model swap + rollback
├── docs/                   — PROJECT.md, DECISIONS.md, GUARDRAILS.md
├── design/                 — Figma mocks (PNG)
├── turbo.json
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml
└── package.json            — workspace root
```

Dependency rule (enforced by tsconfig): airia-types → airia-db → airia-service → airia-fe.
Never the reverse. airia-service must never import React.

