## WHAT TO DO NEXT (Phase 1.5)

Fix the failing TierRouter tests first, then restructure into monorepo.

### Step 1 — Fix failing tests (do this first)

Problem: TierRouter uses localStorage directly. Vitest runs in node environment.
Solution: Already implemented in src/services/TierRouter.ts (KVStorage abstraction).
Action: Update tests/unit/tierRouter.test.ts to use InMemoryStorage injection.
Also create vitest.config.ts at root with environment: 'node'.
Run npm run test:unit — all 26 tests must pass before proceeding.

### Step 2 — Monorepo restructure

Set up pnpm workspaces + Turborepo. Migrate existing src/ into packages/.

Root files to create/update:
- pnpm-workspace.yaml (packages: ["packages/*"])
- turbo.json (pipeline: build depends on ^build, test depends on ^build)
- package.json (root — workspace root, no src)

Package: airia-types
- Move src/types/core.ts → packages/airia-types/src/index.ts
- package.json: name @airia/types, no dependencies
- tsconfig.json: strict, noEmit false, outDir dist

Package: airia-db
- Move src/db/ → packages/airia-db/src/
- package.json: name @airia/db, dep: @airia/types, idb
- Add fake-indexeddb as devDep for tests
- vitest.config.ts: environment node, setupFiles with fake-indexeddb

Package: airia-service
- Move src/services/ → packages/airia-service/src/ (split into sub-modules)
- Move src/hooks/ → packages/airia-service/src/hooks/ (useChat etc are service-layer)
- package.json: name @airia/service, deps: @airia/types, @airia/db
- Must NOT depend on react or any browser-only API
- vitest.config.ts: environment node

Package: airia-fe
- Move remaining src/ → packages/airia-fe/src/
- package.json: name @airia/fe, deps: @airia/types, @airia/db, @airia/service, react, vite
- vite.config.ts stays here
- vitest.config.ts: environment jsdom for component tests

Update all imports to use @airia/* scoped names.

### Step 3 — Integration tests for airia-db

CTO writes these. Use fake-indexeddb. Cover:
- upsertConversation + getConversations (order by updatedAt desc)
- upsertMessage + getMessages (order by timestamp asc)
- deleteConversation cascades to messages and feedback
- Concurrent writes don't corrupt data
- Memory store upsert merges confidence correctly

### Step 4 — Present to CEO

Run pnpm install && pnpm build && pnpm test across all packages.
Show CEO the output. Wait for approval before pushing.

