## COPY RULES (all output, all copy)

- Never say "second brain", "productivity tool", "assistant"
- AIrIA is a buddy. It remembers, it notices, it shows up.
- "Welcome back! How can I help?" is banned — resets the relationship to zero
- Insights always ask permission: "Can I share something I noticed?"
- Tier selection happens AFTER first conversation, not before

