## THEME SYSTEM

6 preset themes — CSS custom properties on [data-theme] attribute:
Dawn (#BA7517 amber, default), Midnight (#534AB7 purple), Forest (#3B6D11 green),
Ocean (#185FA5 blue), Rose (#993556 pink), Slate (#444441 gray)

Orb expressiveness scales with trust level (0-3):
0=quiet, 1=border appears, 2=border thickens, 3=pulse animation

